text.en:
Use one 5-bit `unsigned` temporary and slice it afterwards:

```vhdl
signal s : unsigned(4 downto 0);
...
s    <= ('0' & unsigned(a)) + ('0' & unsigned(b)) + ("0000" & cin);
sum  <= std_logic_vector(s(3 downto 0));
cout <= s(4);
```

text.es:
Usa una señal `unsigned` temporal de 5 bits y luego trocea el resultado:

```vhdl
signal s : unsigned(4 downto 0);
...
s    <= ('0' & unsigned(a)) + ('0' & unsigned(b)) + ("0000" & cin);
sum  <= std_logic_vector(s(3 downto 0));
cout <= s(4);
```
